From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: ITextDocument2Old and ITextDocument2 plain accessors (3731)

riched20: ITextDocument2Old and ITextDocument2 plain accessors

Default tab stop (the layout uses it), effect colours with the documented
defaults, caret type and notification mode shared by both interfaces, client
rectangle in client or screen coordinates, window handle, IMM context,
text limit check, update calls, selection, story count (one story), range from
point, edit collection undo grouping, the can-copy/can-undo/can-redo/undo-limit
properties and the engine version. ITextDocument2 GetWindow, GetImmContext and
ReleaseImmContext take 64-bit values as documented (tom.idl).
---
